docblock.long-description:
```
<?php
// Example: Initialize Configuration object with a file path
$iConfgiration = new \Configuration(STORAGE . '/config/config.jsonc');
```

If no configuration setting name is provided, the whole configuration object will be returned.
Sub-values can be accessed using a dot syntax.

```php
// Example: Get a single configuration value
$value = $iConfiguration->get('some.key');
echo $value;

```php
// Example: Get the whole configuration object
$config = $iConfiguration->get();
```

```
// Example: Check if a key exists in the configuration
$exists = $iConfgiration->has('some.key');
var_dump($exists); // bool(true) or bool(false)
```

```php
// Example: Delete a configuration value
$iConfiguration->delete('some.key');
```

```php
// Example: Set a configuration value dynamically
$iConfgiration->set('new.setting', 'new value');
```

```php
// Example: Show a status bar
\Console::showStatus($done, $total);
```

```php
// Example: Process an array with a progress bar
\Console::progress($iterable, function(mixed $key, mixed $value): void {
    // Do whatever with $key and $value
});
```

```php
// Example: Prompt for confirmation
\Console::confirm('Are you sure?');
```

```php
// Example: Get a value from command line options
$value = \Console::getOption('dry-run');
```

tag.description:
// Fake a response for any page under https://example.com/
Request::fake('https://example.com/*', [
    'body' => '{"message": "Not Found"}',
    'http_code' => 404,
    'headers' => [
        'Content-Type: application/json',
        'X-Error-Detail: Page Not Found'
    ]
]);

// Fake a response for any subdomain of example.com with custom headers
Request::fake('https://*.example.com', [
    'body' => '{"status": "OK"}',
    'http_code' => 200,
    'headers' => [
        'Content-Type: application/json',
        'X-Custom-Header: CustomValue'
    ]
]);

// Fake a response for URLs containing 'example.com' and include custom headers
Request::fake('*example.com*', [
    'body' => '{"content": "Welcome to example.com"}',
    'http_code' => 200,
    'headers' => [
        'Content-Type: text/html',
        'Cache-Control: no-cache'
    ]
]);
